bcunit
------------------------------------------
This is BCUnit, a fork of the defunct project CUnit, with several fixes and
patches applied.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libbcunit-devel-5.4.126-1bl1
  libbcunit1-5.4.126-1bl1
  libncursesw10-6.5+20240427-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libncurses-devel-6.5+20240427-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/BelledonneCommunications/bcunit

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/BelledonneCommunications/bcunit/archive/refs/tags/5.4.126.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack bcunit-5.4.126-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./bcunit-5.4.126-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/bcunit-5.4.126-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/bcunit-5.4.126-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbcunit1-5.4.126-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbcunit-devel-5.4.126-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

